      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوَمُّ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَيَمُّ</span> <i>Better in the performance of the
office termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِمَامَةٌ</span>; followed by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ</span>: (Zj, T, M,
